{"id":"ls7w3euks7681n32pvk9th3xp","title":"Git 优化参考删除性能，Rust 版本提升 18%，纳入 v3.0 计划","originalTitle":"Optimizing Reference Deletions in Git","summary":"Git 团队通过 Rust 重构参考存储，在删除百万级引用时性能提升 18%。测试显示 Rust 版本删除时间比 C 版本快 17.7%（v2.56.0），补丁已合并至 master (fc70f528)，计划在 v2.98 后的 v3.0 中正式启用。优化通过直接写入数据避免格式化开销，适用于 GitLab 等拥有数百万引用的大仓库。","reason":"通过 Rust 重构 Git 的参考存储，在删除百万级引用时性能提升 18%，该方案将纳入 Git 3.0 版本","source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://nayak.im/posts/optimizing-reference-deletion/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T19:37:42.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T22:39:46.980Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T19:37:42.000Z","category":"dev-tools","tags":["性能提升","技术方案"],"score":85,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"performance","name":"性能与基准"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}